WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:28.410
Dear Brother... when it happened, I was looking at the ocean.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.830
I was looking at the beautiful sunset reflected on the ocean.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.250
The sweltering heat of the midday was subsiding,

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.720
...and a cool breeze had begun.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.470
Brother...

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.350
Brother!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:49.600
<b>34. Ablution</b>

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.280
Look! There's a police car.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.750
One of our students must have done something.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.540
Well, everyone, I'll be going.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:14.380
See you later!

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.380
Orihara-kun! Orihara-kun, wait!

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:27.220
You know Asaka Rei-kun well, is that correct?

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.350
Yes...

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.440
What are you talking about, sensei...

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:41.720
It is true. The police just notified us about it.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:44.350
It's a case of mistaken identity.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:45.830
But...

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.040
It's a mistake!!!

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:53.120
Stop lying to me!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:05.340
Sunset was over. I waited until 7:30.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.260
Then, I returned home.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.630
I assumed that something urgent had come up,

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.010
...so that Saint-Juste-sama couldn't make it there.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.770
That's what I thought.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.010
"She owes me an outing in the future."

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:26.340
...I told myself that to avoid being too disappointed.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:30.950
And then, I saw Tomoko waiting at the ticket booth.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:36.000
Though I could see clearly that it was indeed Tomoko there...

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:40.260
...I couldn't fathom why SHE would be meeting me.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.420
It felt so strange...

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:45.050
Let's go... to the hospital.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:47.040
The hospital?

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.830
Saint-Juste-sama is waiting for you at the hospital.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.710
No no, that's all wrong...

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:56.260
Our meeting place is Shiohama station, Lane 2.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:59.180
Yeah, but she couldn't make it and...

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:01.250
Oh I see, Tomoko...

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.530
...Saint-Juste-sama sent you to ask me to meet her.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:06.990
Um.....

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.290
But why the hospital?

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:14.380
Oh... Tomoko... don't cry...

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.080
That hurts, Tomoko...!

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:31.050
Dear Brother...

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:36.970
I couldn't really understand what Tomoko was saying.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:43.480
I... I felt like I was in a strange dream again...

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.730
That's how it felt.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.590
Over here. This way.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:17.470
Go inside. That's the room.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.960
That's not right. Her room's on the fifth floor.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:24.510
Isn't that so?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.300
Stop it, Tomoko -- you're acting strange.

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:06.770
Soup... yes, I should make her some soup.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:08.870
Tomoko?

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:13.410
Right? We should make soup before she wakes up.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:14.550
Isn't that a good idea?

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:18.760
For whom? For whom are you going to make soup?!

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.620
You know who it's for!

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.710
You know! Surely you know!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.430
No!!

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:42.760
Nanako!

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.180
No!!

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.260
No!!

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:51.040
No...!!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:03.690
Saint-Juste-sama! No...!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.990
Excuse me... Excuse me please.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.610
I heard... I heard they won't let us take her body!

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:16.100
Why is that?

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:20.260
Um... these people think she might have...

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:24.670
Suicide?

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:29.290
We haven't determined that, but we don't have the complete picture yet.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:35.970
As a matter of policy, we must retain the body for forensic examination.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.310
We can release her body to you by tomorrow afternoon.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:44.100
Her body... Rei's body... mustn't be touched by a scalpel...

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.590
If only she left a will...

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:50.970
...but she was alone at a remote location,

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.280
and apparently fell into the path of an oncoming train.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.940
There are too many unanswered questions.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.690
Please try to understand.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.100
Thank you for bringing her home, Tomoko-san.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:21.920
Nanako...

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:27.170
Please call me, for any reason at all.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.330
I will be right over.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.470
Was she someone Nanako knew?

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:47.990
Yes...

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:54.670
She was one year older. I hear she was very kind to Nanako.

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:55.900
Hmmm.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:11:01.780
<i>At around 3:15pm today, the body of a student was found near the Shiohama train station.</i>

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:05.880
<i>She was a second year student at the prestigious Seiran High School.</i>

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:11.020
<i>The body was discovered by a train operator heading in the opposite direction.</i>

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:16.680
<i>At this point, police have been unable to locate any witnesses.</i>

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.370
<i>The police have not ruled out suicide.</i>

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:20.840
Suicide...?

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:27.360
Not good. Suicide would not be good at all.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:28.650
Dear...

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:31.420
Can she hold up?

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:37.850
This is probably the most shocking event for Nanako in her life.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:44.520
Just at the most delicate and sensitive age, she is met with a close friend's death.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.620
Her confusion and pain are probably deeper than we can imagine.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:49.870
But...

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:51.050
Yes?

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:55.000
She needs to hold up through this.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:58.790
Yes. She can survive this.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:00.120
Hm.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.570
I am certain.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:02.610
Hm.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:41.280
Is Ms. Fukiko Ichinomiya present?

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.700
Miss? Miss Fukiko?

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.080
A bouquet of roses?

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.860
I am terribly sorry to bother you at this hour,

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:57.280
...we took this order this afternoon but due to our error the delivery was delayed.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:02.060
To Ichinomiya Fukiko-san from Asaka Rei-san...

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:24.390
These flowers are for you.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:30.360
To your bright future, to your beautiful tomorrow,

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:35.840
...and foremost, to your love, with all the gratitude I can express.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:41.420
For you, just for you... Love, from your one and only sister.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:52.390
For you, just for you, Love, from your one and only sister...

00:13:55.170 --> 00:14:00.340
"With all the gratitude I can express" ...she says.

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:06.930
How can you leave this one little letter behind...

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:09.580
...and then go off and die by yourself, alone?

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.530
Who gave you permission to do that??

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:19.080
Does this mean you want me to take that jump myself?

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:24.340
Rei... Rei... Rei...!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.840
Rei!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.770
What? Suicide?

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.030
It said so in the morning paper. Really?

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:40.040
No! Saint-Juste-sama!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.300
Saint-Juste-sama has passed away...?

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.790
Yes -- she was taking a lot of drugs.

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:54.240
She had a lot of pills with her.

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:56.820
"Angel of Death"?

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:59.980
Yes. I was shocked to hear that it was suicide,

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.350
...but you know, she did fit the profile.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:07.060
I'd like to get a list of Asaka-san's friends.

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:15.170
Hello, this is Arikura. How is Nanako doing?

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:19.160
She's kept herself in her room since it happened.

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:21.420
She hasn't eaten at all?

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:27.550
Don't worry - I take her meals, and she does manage to eat about half...

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:32.400
That's good, then. I just wanted to check how she was doing.

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:34.850
I will come by after school.

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:48.700
Nanako?

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:52.250
Will you be going to school?

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:56.160
Yes... staying at home doesn't help.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.480
Nanako...

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:00.380
I'm going now.

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:05.810
Dear Brother...

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:09.790
At first, I really was going to school.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:14.060
I believe that was my intention when I left home.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.800
But my feet were going another way.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:22.330
To the final place.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:28.180
To that final spot where Saint-Juste-sama had said good bye.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:50.880
She jumped... Saint-Juste-sama...

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:54.290
...this is where she jumped...!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.390
Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:21.740
What do I do? From now on...?

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:07.540
Sorry... I'm sorry.

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:11.580
I'm overwhelmed with my own emotions right now.

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:15.590
I don't think I can help you.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:19.400
I myself can hardly understand.

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.650
Sorry.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.760
Um, do you know...

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:33.030
Is there a place near here with a particularly beautiful sunset?

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.620
Sunset?

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.390
Did Saint-Juste-sama ever speak to you about it?

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:47.250
Yesterday... Saint-Juste-sama had planned to take me to a place like that.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:53.140
"Planned"...? That trip that Rei had planned was with you?

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:54.410
Yes.

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:58.500
So Rei was passing through here to meet you...?

00:18:58.720 --> 00:18:59.510
Yes.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.000
Then... then...

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.900
Yes! It was no suicide!

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:08.430
Someone who is committing suicide will not make plans to meet someone!

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:21.960
Thank you. Knowing it wasn't suicide makes me feel better.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:32.660
But... but it still hurts... the awful reality that she is gone.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:39.960
It can't change the fact that we will never hear her voice again.

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:44.130
That smile is no more.

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:49.840
There is nothing anymore!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.130
Nothing at all!

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.610
Dear Brother...

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:03.780
Like yesterday, today was very hot.

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.720
Pardon the interruption again...

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:17.310
Please be seated.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:28.170
You are acquainted with Misonoo Nanako-san?

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:29.740
Yes.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:34.070
According to Misonoo-san, they had planned an outing yesterday.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:40.390
The overpass was a shortcut, and it seems she took it to save time.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:44.510
We don't have confirmation from Misonoo-san's parents yet,

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:48.770
...but Arikura-san provided confirmation that the trip had been planned.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:52.450
We will return the body to you this evening.

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:55.130
The police have concluded that it was an accident.

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:00.300
We have an eye witness.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:04.380
He is a delivery person who happened to pass by.

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:08.350
He was late for his three o'clock appointment.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.050
He says he saw her fall.

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:16.760
She tried to reach for the flowers.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.430
Flowers?

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:23.840
She tried to grab the flowers that she dropped, and fell.

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:26.320
And he also said this...

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:30.310
Asaka-san flew very, very high.

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:37.090
It was terribly unfortunate. A train was coming.

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:41.670
She flew high in the air, like a bird in flight.

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.340
High...

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:28.050
Now... my heart has found great strength for living.

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:38.710
Dear Brother...

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:42.760
There is a place with the most beautiful sunset,

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:46.390
...but its location will forever be a mystery.

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:02.350
Rei, you gave me these roses.

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:12.960
Dear Sister, this is your final gift.

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:16.090
I loved you.

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:19.150
You understood that, didn't you?

00:23:40.740 --> 00:23:44.760
Rei... Rei...

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:47.450
I'm lonely.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
